  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal, written-style verb. Common in academic, technical, and official contexts. The noun form {記述|きじゅつ} means \"description\" or \"statement\" and is used in compound terms.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {記述|きじゅつ}{式|しき} (descriptive-style, essay-type — as in exam questions)\n- {客観的|きゃっかんてき}に{記述|きじゅつ}する (to describe objectively)\n- {詳細|しょうさい}に{記述|きじゅつ}する (to describe in detail)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {書|か}く: to write — everyday verb\n- {記載|きさい}する: to state, to record — more about listing or registering information\n- {描写|びょうしゃ}する: to depict, to describe — focuses on vivid or artistic description",
